      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The point of struggling is simply to feel the weight of your own existence, even if it feels pointless. You don't need a grand reward to make the effort worthwhile; the act of trying is enough to prove you're still here. Letting go of the need for meaning is the only way to stop the exhaustion, so just give yourself permission to stop trying to find a reason.",
